[? if in_technocrat_cooperation and yabloko_in_government: Technocratic Cooperation ?][? if in_opposition and not yabloko_in_government: Opposition ?]

[? if coalition_dissent: Coalition dissent: [+ coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

