= Internal Factions of <span style="color: #F5821F;">**Yabloko**</span>

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The founding-generation current organized around Yavlinsky's personal authority and caution over the party list and messaging.">Yavlinsky wing</span>!} strength: [+ yavlinsky_wing_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ yavlinsky_wing_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Classic European-style social liberalism: welfare-state concerns, coalition pragmatism, and municipal/regional base-building. Anchored by Yabloko's real Socio-Democratic faction, headed by Anatoly Golov.">Socio-Democratic wing</span>!} strength: [+ social_democrat_wing_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ social_democrat_wing_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Market-first, Yeltsin-tolerant members closer to the SPS worldview, most likely to push a merger-of-liberals card.">Liberal Conservative fringe</span>!} strength: [+ liberal_conservative_fringe_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ liberal_conservative_fringe_dissent : dissent +]

[? if green_russia_unlocked: {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Environmental/nuclear-safety activism, based on Yabloko's real official Green Russia faction, headed by Alexey Yablokov.">Green Russia</span>!} strength: [+ green_russia_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ green_russia_dissent : dissent +] ?]

[? if shlosberg_wing_unlocked: {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Uncompromising on civil liberties and war, anchored by Lev Shlosberg's Pskov branch and later national profile.">Shlosberg wing</span>!} strength: [+ shlosberg_wing_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ shlosberg_wing_dissent : dissent +] ?]

[? if shtefanov_fringe_unlocked: {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="A double-edged online/youth current associated with Alexander Shtefanov's public endorsement - raises reach but also state_pressure.">Shtefanov fringe</span>!} strength: [+ shtefanov_fringe_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ shtefanov_fringe_dissent : dissent +] ?]

[? if katz_wing_unlocked and not katz_exited: Katz pressure: [+ katz_pressure +] (external critic pressure, not a strength/dissent faction - see DESIGN_DOC §2) ?]

[? if katz_exited: Katz has left the party and now criticizes it from outside. ?]

@forces
on-arrival: {!
Q.military_strength_2 = Q.military_strength.toFixed(0);
Q.police_strength_2 = Q.police_strength.toFixed(0);
Q.internal_troops_strength_2 = Q.internal_troops_strength.toFixed(0);
Q.mchs_strength_2 = Q.mchs_strength.toFixed(0);
Q.nazbol_strength_2 = Q.nazbol_strength.toFixed(0);
Q.far_right_extremist_strength_2 = Q.far_right_extremist_strength.toFixed(0);
Q.organized_crime_strength_2 = Q.organized_crime_strength.toFixed(0);
!}

= Security Forces

Loyalty below reflects sympathy toward <span style="color: #F5821F;">**Yabloko**</span> specifically, not the state - Yabloko holds no command relationship with any of these forces, so low values are the expected baseline, not a sign of dysfunction. Militancy reflects how well-equipped/armed each force is (0-100), independent of headcount.

<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Russian Armed Forces.">**Military**</span> Strength: [+ military_strength_2 +] thousand

<span style="color: #4A7C2F;">**Military**</span> Loyalty: [+ military_loyalty : loyalty +]

<span style="color: #4A7C2F;">**Military**</span> Militancy: [+ military_militancy : militancy +]

<span class="tooltip-text" title="Regular MVD police (militia).">**Police**</span> Strength: [+ police_strength_2 +] thousand

<span style="color: #003399;">**Police**</span> Loyalty: [+ police_loyalty : loyalty +]

<span style="color: #003399;">**Police**</span> Militancy: [+ police_militancy : militancy +]

<span class="tooltip-text" title="MVD Internal Troops (VV) - the better-armed, riot-control/paramilitary-adjacent tier of the MVD.">**Internal Troops**</span> Strength: [+ internal_troops_strength_2 +] thousand

<span style="color: #003399;">**Internal Troops**</span> Loyalty: [+ internal_troops_loyalty : loyalty +]

<span style="color: #003399;">**Internal Troops**</span> Militancy: [+ internal_troops_militancy : militancy +]

<span class="tooltip-text" title="EMERCOM / MChS, Russia's Emergency Situations Ministry, headed by Sergei Shoigu.">**MChS**</span> Strength: [+ mchs_strength_2 +] thousand (head: [+ mchs_head +])

<span style="color: #FF8C00;">**MChS**</span> Militancy: [+ mchs_militancy : militancy +]

